Div previously founded
MultiOn, the first AI agent

10
00:00:29,210 --> 00:00:32,360
startup, developing agents that
can interact with computers

11
00:00:32,360 --> 00:00:36,500
and assist with everyday tasks,
funded by top Silicon Valley

12
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:37,760
VCs.

13
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:41,210
Div has spent his career at
the intersection of AI research

14
00:00:41,210 --> 00:00:44,510
